.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH ckman-fido-blobs 1  ckman 
.SH NAME
ckman\-fido\-blobs \- Read or replace the CTAP largeBlobs array
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBckman\-fido\-blobs\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Read or replace the CTAP largeBlobs array
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
ckman\-fido\-blobs\-read(1)
Read the whole largeBlobs array to a file (\*(Aq\-\*(Aq for stdout)
.TP
ckman\-fido\-blobs\-write(1)
Replace the whole largeBlobs array from a file (\*(Aq\-\*(Aq for stdin); the file must contain a complete serialized array, e.g. as produced by "blobs read"
.TP
ckman\-fido\-blobs\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
